  <data name="Status_DisclaimerDismissed" xml:space="preserve"><value>Dismissed third-party API usage notice. You should understand the risks before you can use this feature.
If you wish to change up the look of RTX without BetterRTX, try out "RTX LUT manager" instead.</value></data>
